      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Wrecked reactors do not calm down on their own. §6Burning RBMK Debris§r and the wreck of a §3ZIRNOX§r keep releasing §cCore Gas§r, and §6Smoldering Debris§r keeps fissioning for a very long time.\n\nThe §6Fire Extinguisher§r sprays water by default. Craft its tank with niter for a §6Foam Tank§r, or surround it with boron sand for a §6Sand Tank§r:\n- §6Foam§r puts out burning debris about ten times faster, and it is the only way to put out a burning ZIRNOX.\n- §6Boron Sand§r puts out burning debris just as well, and it is the only thing that speeds up the cooling of smoldering debris, by about 40 times.\n\nIf a core melts down, it turns into §cCorium§r, which flows downwards and slowly solidifies into §6Corium§r and §6Corebblestone§r. Both are extremely radioactive, and corebblestone also keeps leaking radon.",
